# .agents/ mirrors .claude/agents + .claude/skills for other agent runners. It IS checked in
# (byte-identical copy; re-sync after changing .claude/ — see docs/agent-notes.md §6). Root AGENTS.md is not mirrored.

# raw/ drafts are deliberately NOT versioned — deleting one is permanent.
# Only the folder's README and template are tracked.
raw/*
!raw/README.md
!raw/_vorlage.md
